  "contentHtml": "<p>동아리 활동 시간이&nbsp;7월에 있고.... 한참 쉬다가... 10월에야 다음 번 활동 시간이 있었어요.</p><p>10월에는 하루 날 잡아 점심시간에 과학실을 오픈하여 실험부스를 설치하는 행사가 계획되어 있었지요.</p><p>그래서 그 행사를 준비하는 시간을 가졌답니다.</p><p>실험 연습 하고.. 원리 공부하고... 홍보물 만드느라 바빴지요.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2422B3455812D0C511\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"550\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20161013_144821.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"550\"  id=\"A_2422B3455812D0C5114B72\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/25294E455812D0C70B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"550\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20161013_144828.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"550\"  id=\"A_25294E455812D0C70BD443\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/253291455812D0C902\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"550\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20161013_144836.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"550\"  id=\"A_253291455812D0C902DBB2\"/></p><p><br></p><p>탱탱볼 실험을 준비하던 친구들은 홍보물을 만드는 과정에서~</p><p>이렇게 예쁜 캐릭터도 만들어냈답니다.^^</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2630C3455812D0CC04\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"550\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20161013_144852.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"550\"  id=\"A_2630C3455812D0CC04DCD5\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/270DCE465812D0B109\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"550\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20161013_122907.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"550\"  id=\"A_270DCE465812D0B109D0C9\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/210A30465812D0B40C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"550\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20161013_144726.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"550\"  id=\"A_210A30465812D0B40C6F12\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/265B6F465812D0B837\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"550\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20161013_144737.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"550\"  id=\"A_265B6F465812D0B8372D0B\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/210F73465812D0BA08\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"550\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20161013_144741.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"550\"  id=\"A_210F73465812D0BA081F2A\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2261D9465812D0BC30\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"550\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20161013_144747.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"550\"  id=\"A_2261D9465812D0BC308E12\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/240C71465812D0BF0B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"550\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20161013_144757.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"550\"  id=\"A_240C71465812D0BF0B6FC0\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/242698455812D0C10D\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"550\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20161013_144809.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"550\"  id=\"A_242698455812D0C10DE36B\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/231CE8455812D0C316\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"550\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20161013_144816.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"550\"  id=\"A_231CE8455812D0C316F986\"/></p><p><br></p><p>작년에 했던 활동과 거의 유사하게 준비했어요. </p><p>(예산이 정해져 있기 때문에.. 돈에 맞춰 실험을 정하다 보니...-.-;;)</p><p><br></p><p>그래도 마침.. 물벼룩이 한 병 생겼고.... (전기 회로를 이용한) 집중력 테스트를 할 수 있는 기구를 하나 구입해서..</p><p>작년에 비해 2가지 활동이 더 늘었네요.</p><p>하지만&nbsp;여전히 인기 많은 코너는 \"자외선 탱탱볼 만들기\"였어요.</p><p><br></p><p>행사 당일 사진은 찍지 못했습니다. 너무 정신없이 바빴어요.</p><p>작년 행사 사진 보시려면 아래를 꾹 눌러주세요.</p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><a href=\"http://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/424t/85\"><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">http://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/424t/85</span></u></a></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">http://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/424t/84</span></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
